# Supabase Postgres connection string.
# Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Database → Connection string → "Session pooler" (recommended for apps).
# Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] with your database password.
#
# Example (Session pooler):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.jmgzxhgkefdfuyiuykrz:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-0-ap-southeast-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
#
# Or the direct connection:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@db.jmgzxhgkefdfuyiuykrz.supabase.co:5432/postgres

